      <description><![CDATA[
<h3>First release 🐈</h3>
<ul>
<li>Six pixel-art pets (cat, dog, fox, rabbit, dinosaur, panda) that live in your menu bar.</li>
<li>The pet's colour follows your Mac's memory, and its speed follows the CPU.</li>
<li>Choose between <b>RAM usage</b> and <b>memory pressure</b>, and pick your own colours.</li>
<li>Flip your pet, or let it turn around on its own.</li>
<li>Battery-friendly: it stops animating when the menu bar is hidden and slows down on battery.</li>
<li><b>Check for Updates…</b> keeps MyPet up to date automatically.</li>
</ul>
      ]]></description>
